    skos:definition "λ-fiber texture component is a type of crystallographic texture which is quality of grain population, i.e., several grains, having a similar orientation (within a misorientation threshold) in relation to the material's reference frame:  <100> family of crystallographic directions are oriented parallel to the normal direction (ND) of a sheet material, i,e., normal to the rolling plane."@en .

